# ::tok After purchasing, everything else was fine except for the software connection, which just couldn't connect. My home uses a TP router, and after searching online, I found that many people have this problem. I spent over two hours adjusting various router settings, and finally managed to set it up using 360WIFI as a medium. During this time, I called Xiaomi customer service, but they didn't have any solutions for this problem and directly told me to contact Amazon for after-sales service.
